          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-panel" style="clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 12px) 0, 100% 12px, 100% 100%, 0 100%); padding: 16px">
          <p style="align-items: center; color: var(--co-text); display: flex; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; gap: 8px; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: none">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-zap" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--co-cyan); flex-shrink: 0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z" />
            </svg>
            "Kto miał kartę?"
            <span style="color: var(--co-green); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-left: auto">
              "⚡1"
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="player-grid">
            <button aria-pressed="false" style="background: var(--co-dark); border: 1px solid var(--co-border); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-dim); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              "Ala"
            </button>
            <button aria-pressed="true" style="background: var(--co-tint-green); border: 1px solid var(--co-green); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--co-tint-green); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-green); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              "Bartek"
            </button>
            <button aria-label="Cezary (Medicover)" aria-pressed="false" style="background: var(--co-dark); border: 1px solid var(--co-border); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-dim); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              <span style="align-items: center; display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; justify-content: center">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-ticket" fill="none" height="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--co-amber); flex-shrink: 0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M2 9a3 3 0 0 1 0 6v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2a3 3 0 0 1 0-6V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z" />
                  <path d="M13 5v2" />
                  <path d="M13 17v2" />
                  <path d="M13 11v2" />
                </svg>
                "Cezary"
              </span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 8px">
            "⚡ Multisport: zwrot 15 zł za każdą godzinę · 🎟️ Medicover: zwrot 15 zł raz na sesję. Kartę gracza (Multisport albo Medicover) ustawiasz w zakładce Gracze."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
          <div>
            <label for="#id1" style="color: var(--co-dim); display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: none">
