            </p>
            <input aria-invalid="false" class="cyber-input" id="#id1" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="np. 56" style="clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%); padding: 10px 14px; width: 100%" type="text" value="" />
            <button style="background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--co-border); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-cyan); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 8px; min-height: 44px; padding: 2px 10px" type="button">
              "Jak ostatnio: 100,00 zł (25,00 zł/kort/h)"
            </button>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--co-tint); border: 1px solid var(--co-tint-line); clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%); padding: 10px 12px">
            <div style="align-items: baseline; display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: space-between">
              <span style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none">
                "Zwrot za karty na portfel"
              </span>
              <span style="color: var(--co-green); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem">
                "−30,00 zł"
              </span>
            </div>
            <div style="align-items: center; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 4px">
              <p style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0px">
                "Wg reguł: 2 × 15 zł za odbicia kart"
              </p>
              <button style="background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--co-border); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-dim); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; min-height: 44px; padding: 2px 8px" type="button">
                "Zmień"
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
