              "Cezary"
            </button>
            <button aria-pressed="true" style="background: var(--co-tint-hi); border: 1px solid var(--co-cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--co-tint-hi); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-cyan); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              "Dorota"
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-panel" style="clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 12px) 0, 100% 12px, 100% 100%, 0 100%); padding: 16px">
          <p style="align-items: center; color: var(--co-text); display: flex; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; gap: 8px; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 12px; text-transform: none">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-zap" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--co-cyan); flex-shrink: 0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z" />
            </svg>
            "Kto miał kartę?"
            <span style="color: var(--co-green); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-left: auto">
              "⚡1 🎟️1"
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="player-grid">
            <button aria-pressed="false" style="background: var(--co-dark); border: 1px solid var(--co-border); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-dim); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              "Ala"
            </button>
            <button aria-pressed="true" style="background: var(--co-tint-green); border: 1px solid var(--co-green); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--co-tint-green); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-green); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              "Bartek"
            </button>
            <button aria-label="Cezary (Medicover)" aria-pressed="true" style="background: var(--co-tint-green); border: 1px solid var(--co-green); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--co-tint-green); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-green); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              <span style="align-items: center; display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; justify-content: center">
                <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-ticket" fill="none" height="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--co-amber); flex-shrink: 0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M2 9a3 3 0 0 1 0 6v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2a3 3 0 0 1 0-6V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z" />
                  <path d="M13 5v2" />
                  <path d="M13 17v2" />
                  <path d="M13 11v2" />
                </svg>
                "Cezary"
              </span>
            </button>
            <button aria-pressed="false" style="background: var(--co-dark); border: 1px solid var(--co-border); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-dim); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 12px; text-transform: none; transition: color 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease" type="button">
              "Dorota"
            </button>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 8px">
            "⚡ Multisport: zwrot 15 zł za każdą godzinę · 🎟️ Medicover: zwrot 15 zł raz na sesję. Kartę gracza (Multisport albo Medicover) ustawiasz w zakładce Gracze."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
          <div>
            <label for="#id1" style="color: var(--co-dim); display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: none">
              "Cena kortu z rezerwacji (zł)"
            </label>
            <p style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0px 0px 8px 0px">
              "Kwota zapłacona przy rezerwacji, jeszcze przed zwrotem za karty. Rakiety doliczysz osobno."
            </p>
            <input aria-invalid="false" class="cyber-input" id="#id1" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="np. 56" style="clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%); padding: 10px 14px; width: 100%" type="text" value="" />
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--co-tint); border: 1px solid var(--co-tint-line); clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%); padding: 10px 12px">
            <div style="align-items: baseline; display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: space-between">
              <span style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none">
                "Zwrot za karty na portfel"
              </span>
              <span style="color: var(--co-green); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem">
                "−30,00 zł"
              </span>
            </div>
            <div style="align-items: center; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 4px">
              <p style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin: 0px">
                "Wg reguł: 2 × 15 zł za odbicia kart"
              </p>
              <button style="background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--co-border); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); color: var(--co-dim); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; min-height: 44px; padding: 2px 8px" type="button">
                "Zmień"
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <button disabled="" style="align-items: center; background: var(--co-panel); border: 1px solid var(--co-border); color: var(--co-dim); cursor: not-allowed; display: flex; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.8125rem; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; letter-spacing: normal; padding: 14px 20px; width: 100%" type="submit">
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-circle-check" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
            </svg>
            "Zapisz sesję"
          </button>
          <p style="color: var(--co-dim); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 8px; text-align: center">
            "Wpisz cenę kortu z rezerwacji"
          </p>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="toast-stack">
    <div class="accent-top glass-surface" role="status" style="background-color: var(--co-toast-info); border: 1px solid var(--co-tint-line); box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--co-tint), var(--glass-shadow); clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 8px) 0, 100% 8px, 100% 100%, 8px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 8px)); overflow: hidden">
      <div style="align-items: flex-start; display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 14px">
        <div style="align-items: center; background: var(--co-tint); border: 1px solid var(--co-tint-line); clip-path: polygon(4px 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 4px) 100%, 0 100%); display: flex; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 6px; padding: 2px 6px">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-terminal" fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="color: var(--co-cyan); flex-shrink: 0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M12 19h8" />
            <path d="m4 17 6-6-6-6" />
          </svg>
          <span style="color: var(--co-cyan); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.8125rem; letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none">
            "SYS"
          </span>
        </div>
        <p style="color: var(--co-toast-text); flex: 1 1 0%; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px">
          "Zmieniono sport — wyczyszczono ustawienia rakietek"
        </p>
        <button aria-label="Zamknij" class="icon-btn" style="align-items: center; background: transparent; color: var(--co-close-btn); cursor: pointer; display: flex; flex-shrink: 0; height: 44px; justify-content: center; margin-right: -8px; margin-top: -10px; width: 44px">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-x" fill="none" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M18 6 6 18" />
            <path d="m6 6 12 12" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
"
`;
